    {
      "name": "5-Reportes",
      "description": "Reportes analíticos de inventario.\n\nPermiso requerido: `READ_INVENTORY`\n\nAuth: `Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}` o `X-Api-Key: {{api_key_id}}.{{api_key_secret}}`",
      "item": [
